"<b>Welcome to the Certificate Wizard.</b>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"In a few easy steps, this wizard will help you with the creation of a "
"certificate. You use your certificates in order to sign messages, to encrypt "
"messages and to decrypt messages that other people send to you in encrypted "
"form.\n"
"<p>\n"
"The certificates can either be generated in a centralized or a decentralized "
"manner. Please contact your local help desk if you are unsure how to create "
"a certificate in your organization."
